vity is firm and red yellow mottled in color  The remaining breast parenchyma consists of adipose tissue with dense fibrous bands dissecting through it  Several lymph nodes are identified in the axillary tail ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 1 1cm in greatest dimension with a pink tan homogeneous cut surface  Section Code  A  nipple  B  scar  C H  biopsy cavity  I  skin and biopsy cavity  J  random sections from breast  K L M  lymph nodes  Resident  Robin E  Kirby  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Leslie Wayne Ottinger  M D  Frank J Leonard vidal  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST TISSUE  MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Checked.
