n ellipse is a REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm gray white stellate area with focal yellow nodules  This stellate density radiates to within REMOVED_DATE from the deep inked margin  Deep to the nipple is a area of white pink lobulated pink breast parenchyma REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm in diameter  Deep to the nipple and 4 5cm from the medial margin and 0 9cm from the deep margin is a white nodular area adjacent to a hemorrhagic area REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm in dimension  The rest of the breast parenchyma is unremarkable  SECTION CODE  A C  lymph nodes  dissected from the axillary tail D E  deep margin  deep to and including the large stellate white area F  representative section of nipple with underlying breast tissue G  representative section of skin with scar  superficial to and including the large white stellate areas HandI  representative section of the medial white firm stellate area immediately deep to the nipple J  deep margin under that area K N  representative section of breast parenchyma O  representative radial section of the medial margin  Also received  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  abdominal fat and skin   are multiple sections of skin  8 x 5 x 2 0cm and unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  9 x 7 x 3 5cm  Representative portion of each is submitted in cassette P  Resident  Mark vanGorder  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Herbert Charles Hoover Jr   M D  James Warren May Jr   M D  Jay Solomon Markowitz  M D  Michael Robert Zenn  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT AND AXILLARY CONTENTS  PART B  SKIN AND FAT  ABDOMEN    report_end  , Checked.
