 resection margin  The nodules are present from 1cm to 3cm away from the main tumor  A  the tumor with inferior resection margin B  tumor with the posterior resection margin  C  the tumor with the anterior resection margin D E  additional representative sections of the tumor F G  nodules Labeled  final shave lateral half of cavity  consist of four fragments of fibroadipose tissue  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm in aggregate  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassette H L  Labeled final shaved medial half of cavity  consist of four fragments of unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  measuring 10 x 3 x 0 7cm in aggregate  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes M Q  Labeled  additional inferior medial margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  Cross sectioning the specimen partially reveals tan white rubbery breast parenchyma  No tumor or nodule is grossly identified  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassette R W  Resident  Mari Mino  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Randall David Gaz  M D  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  W B Jerry Younger  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT LATERAL   FINAL SHAVED MARGIN PART C  BREAST  RIGHT MEDIAL   FINAL SHAVED MARGIN PART D  BREAST  RIGHT MEDIAL INFERIOR   FINAL SHAVED MARGI , Unchecked.
