mas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  22 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 15 39 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast  is an unoriented  5 x 3 x 1 5cm portion of breast tissue  inked and sectioned to reveal an ill defined  2 x 1 x 1cm  tan  gritty region abutting the resection margin at several points  A representative section is frozen as FX 1 and resubmitted in cassette A  The remainder of the tissue is submitted in cassettes B K  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  IVANA DELALLE  MD  PHD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION  INTRADUCTAL CARCINOMA  APPROXIMATELY 1 X 1 X 1 CM  AND INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  APPROXIMATELY 1 X 1 X 1 CM  O R  Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Eugene Jerome Mark  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unchecked.
